{
 "engine": "whisperx",
 "model": "large-v3",
 "lang": "en",
 "wav": "en_full.wav",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start_ms": 38555,
   "end_ms": 40316,
   "text": "It was the fall of 2017."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 49136,
   "end_ms": 60503,
   "text": "My uncle was hit by a truck when he was only 17, and since then had been in a coma for 17 years, until he woke up."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 78685,
   "end_ms": 79886,
   "text": "And he lost his mind."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 83488,
   "end_ms": 85749,
   "text": "Yeah, I don't understand."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 87150,
   "end_ms": 88030,
   "text": "Japanese?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 90672,
   "end_ms": 92032,
   "text": "Oh, my bad!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 92352,
   "end_ms": 97115,
   "text": "I was in Gran Bahama, a fantasy world, where they speak a whole different language."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 97575,
   "end_ms": 102598,
   "text": "Good morning!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 107597,
   "end_ms": 108717,
   "text": "Let's take your temperature."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 113859,
   "end_ms": 115940,
   "text": "All right."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 116200,
   "end_ms": 117240,
   "text": "I'll check on you later."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 126424,
   "end_ms": 128943,
   "text": "You're Takafumi, my sister's kid."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 129845,
   "end_ms": 133246,
   "text": "But where is... everyone else?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 136488,
   "end_ms": 139070,
   "text": "Well, our family had a huge falling out because of you."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 139730,
   "end_ms": 143513,
   "text": "What to do with you while you were in a coma, and let me tell you, it wasn't cheap."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 145194,
   "end_ms": 147795,
   "text": "My mom said she didn't want to see you."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 153059,
   "end_ms": 154320,
   "text": "Ikura's Quora."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 158082,
   "end_ms": 158803,
   "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 159843,
   "end_ms": 161945,
   "text": "I'll prove Gran Bahamal is real."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 162774,
   "end_ms": 164635,
   "text": "Uh, you really don't?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 165596,
   "end_ms": 167117,
   "text": "Wargrant Seld!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 170759,
   "end_ms": 171179,
   "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 172359,
   "end_ms": 173700,
   "text": "Wargrant Magna!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 177522,
   "end_ms": 178403,
   "text": "Wargrant Rald!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 178883,
   "end_ms": 180624,
   "text": "This is just sad."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 180644,
   "end_ms": 182185,
   "text": "Wargrant Gad!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 182965,
   "end_ms": 183706,
   "text": "Wargrant Pat!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 183966,
   "end_ms": 191030,
   "text": "Hey, Uncle, money has been a little tight lately, so I brought some documents for you to sign."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 191862,
   "end_ms": 195265,
   "text": "And after that, they're going to send you somewhere to help you get back on your feet."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 195285,
   "end_ms": 195865,
   "text": "Wind, carry."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 206093,
   "end_ms": 206973,
   "text": "What the hell?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 207514,
   "end_ms": 208675,
   "text": "Wind, return it."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 211377,
   "end_ms": 213118,
   "text": "Of course, it's Japanese here."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 225246,
   "end_ms": 229367,
   "text": "That's all real."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 231688,
   "end_ms": 232708,
   "text": "Hold on now."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 233108,
   "end_ms": 235669,
   "text": "Did you just say you were sending me away somewhere?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 236189,
   "end_ms": 236809,
   "text": "No, I didn't."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 237929,
   "end_ms": 238529,
   "text": "You sure?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 238629,
   "end_ms": 239029,
   "text": "Yeah, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 239069,
   "end_ms": 239810,
   "text": "So what was that?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 241450,
   "end_ms": 241970,
   "text": "It's magic."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 243190,
   "end_ms": 243590,
   "text": "Fire."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 245051,
   "end_ms": 246091,
   "text": "Whoa, awesome."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 246431,
   "end_ms": 247671,
   "text": "Wait, how are you doing that?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 247691,
   "end_ms": 249272,
   "text": "That's nothing."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 249332,
   "end_ms": 251452,
   "text": "I want to know if Sega won the console wars."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 251932,
   "end_ms": 252073,
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 253053,
   "end_ms": 253673,
   "text": "Sega?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 256317,
   "end_ms": 260221,
   "text": "Well, these days, Sony and Nintendo are the biggest console makers."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 260862,
   "end_ms": 261101,
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 261242,
   "end_ms": 261863,
   "text": "No Sega?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 262664,
   "end_ms": 264265,
   "text": "Is this important?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 264285,
   "end_ms": 264886,
   "text": "Sega!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 265967,
   "end_ms": 268929,
   "text": "Well, they stopped making consoles."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 273213,
   "end_ms": 274454,
   "text": "Ikura's Kuora."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 276416,
   "end_ms": 278878,
   "text": "Hey, Uncle, what's Ikura's Kuora mean?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 281043,
   "end_ms": 284984,
   "text": "It's a memory erasing spell, so I can forget sad things."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 286325,
   "end_ms": 288165,
   "text": "Sega was that important?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 288585,
   "end_ms": 291146,
   "text": "There were a lot of sad times in Gran Bahamo."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 291646,
   "end_ms": 292186,
   "text": "Wanna see?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 293067,
   "end_ms": 294067,
   "text": "Uh, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 305190,
   "end_ms": 306031,
   "text": "Oh, God, no."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 306911,
   "end_ms": 308031,
   "text": "Make me forget."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 309112,
   "end_ms": 310052,
   "text": "It's sad, right?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 311080,
   "end_ms": 314001,
   "text": "Spirits of memory, deliver unto..."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 314021,
   "end_ms": 316362,
   "text": "I guess Sega meant a lot to him."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 320284,
   "end_ms": 324245,
   "text": "A week later, my uncle was discharged."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 324685,
   "end_ms": 327626,
   "text": "So we decided to find a way to make some money off his powers."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 328447,
   "end_ms": 330888,
   "text": "We started by uploading videos to YouTube."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 331388,
   "end_ms": 334189,
   "text": "But we only earned about 60,000 yen in ad revenue."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 352923,
   "end_ms": 374172,
   "text": "Refrain 消しざる記憶 Relight 物語の常 垣間見せる言葉で Don't end this money changing どうしたって変えられない 目的を忘れないでいて 誰か決めたんだ そんな生き方らしくないわ やりたい"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 441257,
   "end_ms": 445199,
   "text": "I've been meaning to ask you, why do you have such a big place?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 447640,
   "end_ms": 451142,
   "text": "I was living with someone, but it got complicated."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 451682,
   "end_ms": 453223,
   "text": "Like with a lover?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 453843,
   "end_ms": 454504,
   "text": "Not like that."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 455324,
   "end_ms": 455865,
   "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 456605,
   "end_ms": 458346,
   "text": "Listen, they were just a roommate."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 458606,
   "end_ms": 458886,
   "text": "Get it?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 460287,
   "end_ms": 461327,
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 462848,
   "end_ms": 464769,
   "text": "Roommates weren't a thing back then?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 465389,
   "end_ms": 468191,
   "text": "Whoa, you looked that up really fast."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 468831,
   "end_ms": 470192,
   "text": "What a tiny computer."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 471069,
   "end_ms": 472550,
   "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 474310,
   "end_ms": 474750,
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 475551,
   "end_ms": 476891,
   "text": "That's so weird."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 477711,
   "end_ms": 479972,
   "text": "You finding a friend to live with you here?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 486474,
   "end_ms": 489395,
   "text": "Uncle, so tell me, what were people like in the other world?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 489576,
   "end_ms": 490456,
   "text": "What about your friends?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 492817,
   "end_ms": 495538,
   "text": "I flew solo pretty much the entire time I was there."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 503977,
   "end_ms": 504377,
   "text": "I see."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 512720,
   "end_ms": 515301,
   "text": "All the people in the other world were really hot."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 515861,
   "end_ms": 517621,
   "text": "You trip over beautiful people."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 518482,
   "end_ms": 519543,
   "text": "Oh, really?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 520602,
   "end_ms": 521924,
   "text": "I must have been hideous."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 531977,
   "end_ms": 534339,
   "text": "They hunted me down like I was an orc."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 535360,
   "end_ms": 536901,
   "text": "Uncle, hold on."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 537321,
   "end_ms": 538782,
   "text": "And they would... Stop!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 538983,
   "end_ms": 542946,
   "text": "I'm just trying to wash the dishes right now, man."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 543966,
   "end_ms": 545608,
   "text": "It wasn't like that every day."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 545988,
   "end_ms": 548410,
   "text": "But there was one girl who was really aggressive."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 548470,
   "end_ms": 549611,
   "text": "Tell me this later!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 549891,
   "end_ms": 553034,
   "text": "She would show up every day to harass me to my face."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 553494,
   "end_ms": 557437,
   "text": "No matter what I did to prove myself, she would treat me like garbage."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 560239,
   "end_ms": 560900,
   "text": "That's awful."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 561920,
   "end_ms": 564662,
   "text": "Even in a fantasy world, that stuff happens."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 565623,
   "end_ms": 569686,
   "text": "When we first met, I saved her from a monster and she didn't even thank me."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 570326,
   "end_ms": 571928,
   "text": "What was her problem?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 572008,
   "end_ms": 572428,
   "text": "Right?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 573068,
   "end_ms": 575690,
   "text": "She was like, nobody asked for your help."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 575991,
   "end_ms": 576991,
   "text": "Don't touch me."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 577011,
   "end_ms": 579953,
   "text": "Then I said, I didn't save you just to hit on you."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 580134,
   "end_ms": 581134,
   "text": "How stuck up are you?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 581314,
   "end_ms": 586018,
   "text": "Then she's all like, I'm the only one who can even stand to be around your orange face without puking."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 586038,
   "end_ms": 587119,
   "text": "You fool, right, Jack?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 588533,
   "end_ms": 591155,
   "text": "She was just really mean to me every day, all right?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 591715,
   "end_ms": 593576,
   "text": "I ditched her in a city and then ran off."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 599940,
   "end_ms": 600900,
   "text": "Don't touch me!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 602381,
   "end_ms": 603502,
   "text": "I don't need your help!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 605503,
   "end_ms": 610606,
   "text": "I'm the only one who can stand your orc face without puking, four-eyed jerk."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 613087,
   "end_ms": 613708,
   "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 617052,
   "end_ms": 623400,
   "text": "The tsundere archetype wasn't established until 2004, four years after my uncle was in a coma."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 624441,
   "end_ms": 625863,
   "text": "What happened to her?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 626384,
   "end_ms": 626604,
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 627365,
   "end_ms": 627866,
   "text": "I don't know."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 630089,
   "end_ms": 634955,
   "text": "If I'm being honest, things weren't that great for me in the other world."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 637170,
   "end_ms": 643972,
   "text": "But coming back here, the internet, fiber lines, Wi-Fi, it's all great."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 644472,
   "end_ms": 647873,
   "text": "And people around the world love my videos."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 649154,
   "end_ms": 649534,
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 656127,
   "end_ms": 661149,
   "text": "It was then that my uncle fell into a new fantasy world known as the Internet."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 661549,
   "end_ms": 661809,
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 662410,
   "end_ms": 664551,
   "text": "How does he know my face is red?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 664971,
   "end_ms": 665871,
   "text": "Am I on camera?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 666291,
   "end_ms": 667292,
   "text": "It's Internet slang."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 667832,
   "end_ms": 670073,
   "text": "And I never write in my own comments."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 670373,
   "end_ms": 671313,
   "text": "Hey, don't worry."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 671714,
   "end_ms": 672634,
   "text": "It's just a joke."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 674015,
   "end_ms": 677896,
   "text": "Hey, why are they writing a bunch of W's?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 677936,
   "end_ms": 680237,
   "text": "He still needs to learn about trolls."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 684929,
   "end_ms": 685810,
   "text": "I want this phone."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 686831,
   "end_ms": 688412,
   "text": "It doesn't flip, it spins."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 689152,
   "end_ms": 690674,
   "text": "But it's 2G."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 691815,
   "end_ms": 694016,
   "text": "So I buy it through this online auction, right?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 694257,
   "end_ms": 697839,
   "text": "The problem is, it uses an old network, so I don't think you could even make calls."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 698600,
   "end_ms": 700041,
   "text": "But it spins."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 700802,
   "end_ms": 703064,
   "text": "Yeah, but how would you get in touch with your old friends?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 704425,
   "end_ms": 712151,
   "text": "Takafumi, do you think a man who committed himself to SEGA truly deserves to live a full life?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 715372,
   "end_ms": 718816,
   "text": "Why is he letting a game system dictate his life so much?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 723061,
   "end_ms": 725464,
   "text": "Oh, this one looks like the cheapest price."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 726085,
   "end_ms": 728307,
   "text": "You already looked it up?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 728347,
   "end_ms": 730350,
   "text": "Those little smartphones are really fast."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 730890,
   "end_ms": 732212,
   "text": "You could always learn to use one."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 733813,
   "end_ms": 736514,
   "text": "Touching, swiping, pinching."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 737234,
   "end_ms": 739435,
   "text": "I prefer to have a bunch of buttons to push."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 740055,
   "end_ms": 740675,
   "text": "I guess."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 741155,
   "end_ms": 746797,
   "text": "They don't make new versions of the cool phones that slide open or spin anymore, do they?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 747337,
   "end_ms": 748238,
   "text": "It's innovation."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 748838,
   "end_ms": 750078,
   "text": "Everything is touchscreens."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 750598,
   "end_ms": 752779,
   "text": "A lot happens in 17 years."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 753139,
   "end_ms": 757181,
   "text": "You know, I did some technical innovations of my own in the other world."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 757761,
   "end_ms": 758241,
   "text": "Oh, yeah?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 759865,
   "end_ms": 763486,
   "text": "I met a pot that overflowed with water to stop a village's drought."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 764046,
   "end_ms": 764907,
   "text": "Whoa, how?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 766427,
   "end_ms": 767807,
   "text": "I used two spells."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 768748,
   "end_ms": 770808,
   "text": "It'll just be easier to show you how I did it."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 771468,
   "end_ms": 772389,
   "text": "Digger as Elrond."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 772929,
   "end_ms": 777710,
   "text": "Whoa."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 780151,
   "end_ms": 781812,
   "text": "Is this one of your memories?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 782492,
   "end_ms": 784973,
   "text": "There are these spell cards charged with magic."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 786840,
   "end_ms": 792322,
   "text": "With a lot of work, I managed to reverse the electrolysis process to create water."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 793682,
   "end_ms": 795142,
   "text": "You beat modern science."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 795922,
   "end_ms": 797603,
   "text": "Wow, you must have blown all their minds."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 797663,
   "end_ms": 800644,
   "text": "I mean, I bet all those villagers were cheering your name."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 801864,
   "end_ms": 802144,
   "text": "Nah."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 803144,
   "end_ms": 810967,
   "text": "They tried to hang me."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 810987,
   "end_ms": 812347,
   "text": "They destroyed the pot."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 816598,
   "end_ms": 819079,
   "text": "I guess what I did was sacrilegious."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 819099,
   "end_ms": 820400,
   "text": "Stop!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 822521,
   "end_ms": 823602,
   "text": "Someone rescued you."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 824822,
   "end_ms": 826543,
   "text": "Who's that awful woman?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 826643,
   "end_ms": 827104,
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 827124,
   "end_ms": 827724,
   "text": "That's her?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 828064,
   "end_ms": 830485,
   "text": "Yes, I know he has an evil face."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 830826,
   "end_ms": 831766,
   "text": "It's like an orc's."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 831826,
   "end_ms": 836429,
   "text": "I understand why you wouldn't trust him, but I promise... More red dragon."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 840851,
   "end_ms": 841791,
   "text": "Good grief."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 842752,
   "end_ms": 844313,
   "text": "Yeah, that's pretty much it."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 850083,
   "end_ms": 850623,
   "text": "I get it."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 852364,
   "end_ms": 854385,
   "text": "First-person view is hard to follow."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 854785,
   "end_ms": 855806,
   "text": "Hey, what's that?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 856806,
   "end_ms": 860428,
   "text": "Hmm, I can swipe here to rotate the camera around."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 860448,
   "end_ms": 861528,
   "text": "Yep, there we are."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 861808,
   "end_ms": 862569,
   "text": "You can do that?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 862869,
   "end_ms": 864109,
   "text": "Pinch in to zoom out."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 865170,
   "end_ms": 866631,
   "text": "Whoa, you weren't kidding."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 866651,
   "end_ms": 867651,
   "text": "You were being hunted."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 868371,
   "end_ms": 870973,
   "text": "Oh, can we see what happened to that girl?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 871273,
   "end_ms": 873974,
   "text": "Yeah, I'll pinch out to zoom in."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 878769,
   "end_ms": 881150,
   "text": "That coward."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 881331,
   "end_ms": 883472,
   "text": "He ran away?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 887456,
   "end_ms": 888336,
   "text": "Loser."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 889637,
   "end_ms": 891519,
   "text": "She saved you and she's hot!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 892199,
   "end_ms": 892920,
   "text": "Yeah, I know."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 892940,
   "end_ms": 894221,
   "text": "I'm a coward."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 894501,
   "end_ms": 894862,
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 897344,
   "end_ms": 900206,
   "text": "My auction!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 900847,
   "end_ms": 905290,
   "text": "I'm dead!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 905410,
   "end_ms": 906711,
   "text": "Wait, how much is delivery?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 915155,
   "end_ms": 917097,
   "text": "My God, 2000!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 917438,
   "end_ms": 919820,
   "text": "Their address is on some remote island."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 922243,
   "end_ms": 925086,
   "text": "There's no fee if you meet them to get the phone in person."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 947932,
   "end_ms": 953655,
   "text": "I'll be back."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 957538,
   "end_ms": 958578,
   "text": "I'm home!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 963381,
   "end_ms": 963821,
   "text": "Question."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 967243,
   "end_ms": 968984,
   "text": "Could you pick up these headphones for me?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 969705,
   "end_ms": 970245,
   "text": "Where are they?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 970886,
   "end_ms": 971446,
   "text": "Kumamoto."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 976158,
   "end_ms": 976658,
   "text": "This sofa?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 977398,
   "end_ms": 978518,
   "text": "That looks really heavy."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 978739,
   "end_ms": 980179,
   "text": "I will give you a shoulder massage."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 980859,
   "end_ms": 981699,
   "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 981719,
   "end_ms": 982079,
   "text": "Oh, okay."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 983279,
   "end_ms": 987000,
   "text": "That's how Uncle learned to bid online without paying shipping fees."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 989741,
   "end_ms": 990161,
   "text": "Thanks."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 992461,
   "end_ms": 994562,
   "text": "Hey, I would have gone to pick that up for you."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 995082,
   "end_ms": 995642,
   "text": "It was free."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 995762,
   "end_ms": 996722,
   "text": "I have Amazon Prime."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 997262,
   "end_ms": 998142,
   "text": "Is there a box cutter?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1000763,
   "end_ms": 1001043,
   "text": "Here."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1001383,
   "end_ms": 1002263,
   "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1006377,
   "end_ms": 1026862,
   "text": "come from the storage spell by the way that thing can kill dragons so be careful that's so cool did you bring anything else back with you like a magic sword I also have precious metals"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1028085,
   "end_ms": 1031528,
   "text": "The stone is a mermaid tear crystallized by magic."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1031789,
   "end_ms": 1034171,
   "text": "And the band was carved from rainbow coral."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1034290,
   "end_ms": 1036653,
   "text": "In the other world, you could buy a castle with this."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1036894,
   "end_ms": 1037314,
   "text": "Sell them!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1037374,
   "end_ms": 1039195,
   "text": "Sell them all!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1039376,
   "end_ms": 1039977,
   "text": "50 yen."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1041979,
   "end_ms": 1045362,
   "text": "I took them to a pawn shop, and they told me 50 yen."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1045702,
   "end_ms": 1046483,
   "text": "It's too rare."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1048159,
   "end_ms": 1051301,
   "text": "Hmm, we're not getting as many views as I thought."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1051902,
   "end_ms": 1053043,
   "text": "I need a new idea."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1053723,
   "end_ms": 1059327,
   "text": "Uncle, so I'm guessing you had this because you were going to give it to someone?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1059868,
   "end_ms": 1062289,
   "text": "No, it's just a commemorative trophy."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1063050,
   "end_ms": 1066152,
   "text": "You have to beat a pretty hard dungeon to get one of them, though."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1067013,
   "end_ms": 1067453,
   "text": "I see."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1077340,
   "end_ms": 1078781,
   "text": "You wanna talk about love?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1079362,
   "end_ms": 1079542,
   "text": "No."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1080203,
   "end_ms": 1082345,
   "text": "I doubt you ever had a romance in the other world."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1082705,
   "end_ms": 1083225,
   "text": "No thanks."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1083345,
   "end_ms": 1084266,
   "text": "Yes, I did."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1084486,
   "end_ms": 1086368,
   "text": "But I've been alive over 30 years."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1086428,
   "end_ms": 1087970,
   "text": "I've gotten plenty of action."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1090392,
   "end_ms": 1092714,
   "text": "My first love was in elementary school."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1093254,
   "end_ms": 1093835,
   "text": "Who was she?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1094676,
   "end_ms": 1095777,
   "text": "Sonic and Tails."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1097138,
   "end_ms": 1097338,
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1106490,
   "end_ms": 1111032,
   "text": "I'd go to the toy store every afternoon to watch the video demo play."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1113193,
   "end_ms": 1114894,
   "text": "That title screen was so cute."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1115494,
   "end_ms": 1116795,
   "text": "I never got tired of it."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1117475,
   "end_ms": 1119296,
   "text": "Do you have people stories?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1119556,
   "end_ms": 1119737,
   "text": "Hm?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1120237,
   "end_ms": 1120637,
   "text": "Oh, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1121838,
   "end_ms": 1124639,
   "text": "There was this girl named Kaede Nanase."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1125755,
   "end_ms": 1127316,
   "text": "She was killed by a worm."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1128057,
   "end_ms": 1130899,
   "text": "Then her brain was transferred into an evil cyborg body."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1131259,
   "end_ms": 1134021,
   "text": "She attacked me after I hunted down the seven force."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1134582,
   "end_ms": 1137023,
   "text": "She's the boss of level three and takes on five?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1137043,
   "end_ms": 1139786,
   "text": "This man had no life outside of games."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1141287,
   "end_ms": 1143068,
   "text": "Were there any nice girls in the other world?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1143088,
   "end_ms": 1144489,
   "text": "Oh, sure."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1144749,
   "end_ms": 1145110,
   "text": "Really?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1146771,
   "end_ms": 1148252,
   "text": "Icarus, now run."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1170110,
   "end_ms": 1174731,
   "text": "Thank you very much"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1202036,
   "end_ms": 1204878,
   "text": "I managed to save her from that awful monster."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1204998,
   "end_ms": 1209360,
   "text": "It looks more like she's sacrificing herself to protect her brothers."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1210120,
   "end_ms": 1211141,
   "text": "Pretty cool, right?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1211721,
   "end_ms": 1215283,
   "text": "I think we got ambushed by goblins or something soon after this."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1215623,
   "end_ms": 1218425,
   "text": "Well, I fell off a cliff, never saw her again."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1219005,
   "end_ms": 1220346,
   "text": "That must have been terrible."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1220366,
   "end_ms": 1222827,
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1223775,
   "end_ms": 1227376,
   "text": "Those kids are looking a little suspicious back there."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1227916,
   "end_ms": 1229637,
   "text": "I should look at what attacked me."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1230117,
   "end_ms": 1231637,
   "text": "I'm sure it was a goblin."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1231957,
   "end_ms": 1232257,
   "text": "Yeah?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1232617,
   "end_ms": 1233998,
   "text": "Oh, yeah, definitely."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1235698,
   "end_ms": 1237659,
   "text": "Whatever it was, almost killed me."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1237819,
   "end_ms": 1239299,
   "text": "And that awful woman showed up."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1239499,
   "end_ms": 1239799,
   "text": "Really?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1240360,
   "end_ms": 1241960,
   "text": "I hate to admit it, but she saved me."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1254578,
   "end_ms": 1255318,
   "text": "But why?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1256539,
   "end_ms": 1257679,
   "text": "Why save me?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1258139,
   "end_ms": 1259019,
   "text": "I did you a favor."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1259840,
   "end_ms": 1260580,
   "text": "You're in my debt."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1261220,
   "end_ms": 1264061,
   "text": "Now you'll spend the rest of your life trying to repay me."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1266342,
   "end_ms": 1271743,
   "text": "Rest of my life?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1272183,
   "end_ms": 1273064,
   "text": "I didn't mean it like that."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1273084,
   "end_ms": 1275404,
   "text": "It's not like we're going to be together forever."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1275424,
   "end_ms": 1279025,
   "text": "Stop it!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1279526,
   "end_ms": 1280366,
   "text": "Stay right there!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1280386,
   "end_ms": 1282546,
   "text": "I don't have much to pay you with."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1283227,
   "end_ms": 1284027,
   "text": "What about this?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1288483,
   "end_ms": 1291604,
   "text": "It's a cosmite ring, one of only seven in the whole world."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1292364,
   "end_ms": 1293025,
   "text": "Hey, stop!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1293505,
   "end_ms": 1299607,
   "text": "What are you doing?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1299727,
   "end_ms": 1300427,
   "text": "It should fit."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1300968,
   "end_ms": 1302108,
   "text": "Wait a second."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1302128,
   "end_ms": 1302608,
   "text": "This is too fast."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1302628,
   "end_ms": 1303269,
   "text": "You don't want it?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1304449,
   "end_ms": 1304609,
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1304749,
   "end_ms": 1306410,
   "text": "I do."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1322210,
   "end_ms": 1324092,
   "text": "I just proposed to her?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1324232,
   "end_ms": 1325073,
   "text": "Is that allowed?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1325873,
   "end_ms": 1330117,
   "text": "From her reaction, it looks like they have the same marriage customs as us in the other world."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1330617,
   "end_ms": 1331718,
   "text": "At least it seems so."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1332099,
   "end_ms": 1332979,
   "text": "Of course I did."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1335301,
   "end_ms": 1338744,
   "text": "I even got the ring appraised for her in the next town."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1339264,
   "end_ms": 1340365,
   "text": "Oh, come on, Uncle!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1346842,
   "end_ms": 1347383,
   "text": "Oh, no."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1347423,
   "end_ms": 1350284,
   "text": "Is this the town you said you managed to lose her in?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1350805,
   "end_ms": 1352606,
   "text": "No, she hung around after this."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1352926,
   "end_ms": 1354707,
   "text": "You know, I think she wanted my money."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1355368,
   "end_ms": 1356669,
   "text": "I put it all in the bank."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1356709,
   "end_ms": 1358290,
   "text": "Where are you going next, Tom?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1358470,
   "end_ms": 1358710,
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1358830,
   "end_ms": 1359591,
   "text": "You're resting here?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1359791,
   "end_ms": 1360871,
   "text": "What a coincidence."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1360891,
   "end_ms": 1362052,
   "text": "So am I."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1362132,
   "end_ms": 1363133,
   "text": "She's persistent."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1364994,
   "end_ms": 1369457,
   "text": "Anyway, these rare items are all shockingly easy to use."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1370638,
   "end_ms": 1372759,
   "text": "And you could put that dagger in here, too."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1373160,
   "end_ms": 1373520,
   "text": "Uh, sure."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1386747,
   "end_ms": 1390088,
   "text": "Uncle's brand new video broke over two million views."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1390928,
   "end_ms": 1391988,
   "text": "Fall 2017."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1392048,
   "end_ms": 1405912,
   "text": "My life with my uncle just got a whole lot more interesting."
  }
 ],
 "meta": {
  "audio_s": 1422.0,
